     "1 on every pair ",
     StyleBox["u \[PrecedesEqual] v", "TI"],
     ", the zeta function of the incidence algebra"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"bb6ac1d9-2e67-440f-aca5-49282bb228f0"], 
    Cell["\[LongDash]", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "afcde672-d85b-4092-afbe-c0b41976bd38"], Cell[TextData[{
     "the sum of ",
     StyleBox["f", "TI"],
