  "970cbc27-159f-4ec4-8a27-19aa0f7cfb33"],
 " with the same options inverts the antiderivative, in both orders and for \
every method."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"cd36237a-789c-494c-af95-46a0c3fba549"],

